n\tmso-pagination:widow-orphan;\n\tfont-size:10.0pt;\n\tfont-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;\n\tmso-bidi-language:BO;}\n</style>\n<![endif]-->\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"hl\">Поскольку оно преподает, сжимая основные положения как сутр, так и тантр, его содержание является полностью полным;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Сутра болгаш Тантраның эртемин мөөңнээш, бо ийи өөредигниң\nтайылбырын тергиин кылдыр дооскаш;</p>",
      "confirmed": false,
      "note": "<p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-18e819t\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 18.2864px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1uxruac\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 1.1429rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i 'khrid gser gyi yang zhun</strong></p><blockquote style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18.2864px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-18e819t\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1.1429rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-word;\"><strong class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1uxruac\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 1.1429rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Original:</strong> མདོ་སྔགས་ཀྱི་གནད་བསྡུས་ནས་སྟོན་པས་བརྗོད་བྱ་ཡོངས་སུ་རྫོགས་པ་དང༌། སེམས་འདུལ་བའི་རིམ་པ་གཙོ་བོར་བྱས་པས་ཉམས་སུ་ལེན་བདེ་བ་དང༌། ཀླུ་སྒྲུབ་ཀྱི་ལུགས་ལ་མཁས་པའི་རིག་པའི་ཁུ་བྱུག་དང༌།</p></blockquote><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-18e819t\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 18.2864px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-1uxruac\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 600; margin: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 1.1429rem; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33);\">Translation:</strong> Because it teaches by condensing the crucial points of both Sutra and Tantra, its subject matter is entirely complete; because it prioritizes the stages of taming the mind, it is easy to put into practice; and [because it is adorned with the instructions of] Vidyākokila, who was learned in the tradition of Nāgārjuna, and...</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-18e819t\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 18.2864px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">བྱང་ཆུབ་ལམ་གྱི་རིམ་པའི་འཁྲིད་གསེར་གྱི་ཡང་ཞུན། · BO_TSD_BO_DNZ-03-GA-009:9</p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-18e819t\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 18.2864px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br></p><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-18e819t\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 18.2864px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); word-break: break-word; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span class=\"hl-red\">бо одуругну очулдуруп турда примечание унуп келген:&nbsp;</span>ཀླུ་སྒྲུབ་ཀྱི་ལུགས་ལ་མཁས་པའི་རིགས་པའི་ཁུ་བྱུག་དང༌།</p>",
      "bookmarked": false
    },
